WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.378
Polycyclic groups, recognized by shape.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.995
Gromov handled nilpotent groups in nineteen eighty-one; the solvable analogue stayed open.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.368
Large-scale self-maps keep a height coordinate, and that forces algebraic structure.

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.535
Claimed: every virtually polycyclic group is recognized.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.208
Lean: main theorem.
